Z||000000||bcwawright||05-15-2001||11:56 PM||||Need to know if there is someone that is reliable that can rebuild my tranny. Seems like even Getrag in Germany doesn't even want to do the job.<P>Bruce<BR>88GT Turbo F355 Spyder replica||||reg||5
Z||000001||terryk||05-16-2001||12:22 AM||||That's because Getrag had little to do with it.<P>A dealer or many trans shops. They are expensive to rebuilt. Very expensive.||||reg||1
Z||000002||87GTZ34||05-16-2001||12:26 AM||||Call Rodney Dickman and get his opinion.  He is quite familiar with them but I don't know he rebuilds them anymore.  He might have suggestions on where to bring it though.||||reg||1
